<title>UK: Goldman Sachs Group sets 10 bln escudo 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs Group sets 10 bln escudo 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Cisf and Banco Finantia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP LP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTE    BASE	 6M-LISBOR MATURITY    24.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     20 BP     PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
